@startuml hld-1
title HLD-1 Login and session architecture
skinparam monochrome true
left to right direction
component "Web UI\nlogin page\nOTP page" as Web_UI
component "API gateway\ntoken check\nidle timer" as API_gateway
component "Auth service\npassword check\nlockout counter" as Auth_service
component "OTP service\n6-digit OTP\n3-minute expiry" as OTP_service
node "SMS gateway" as SMS_gateway <<external>>
database "Customer store\npassword hash\nfailed count" as Customer_store
Web_UI --> API_gateway : HTTPS
API_gateway --> Auth_service
Auth_service --> OTP_service
OTP_service --> SMS_gateway
Auth_service --> Customer_store
@enduml